# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What deliberately stays out of this repository.
#
# The rule is size and privacy, not tidiness. Everything needed to run the
# site and its editing tools is tracked; nothing else is.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Original photography and video: 3.4 GB of .ARW, .DNG and .MP4. Individual
# files exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit, so this cannot be pushed even if it were
# wanted. The site's images are cut from these and are tracked under uploads/.
# The originals live on the Backup Plus drive.
website/

# Cafe playlist. Not website material.
music/

# Personal documents, notes and a WhatsApp export. Nothing here is needed to
# build or edit the site, and it should not be shared with collaborators.
other/

# Compiled Python, regenerates itself on every run.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The previous repository, kept only until the new remote is confirmed working.
# Delete it once the first push and the first cPanel deploy have both succeeded.
.git-OLD-archive/

# Editor and OS litter
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
